      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The trace viewer reads kernel traces through the kernel read API. Its code lives in the trace-viewer repo ("
        },
        {
          "insert": "Codecaine-AI/trace-viewer",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "), a sibling Core repo. This page names what the kernel gives a viewer and where the viewer packages are."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
